{"title":"making money juice cleanse","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/making-money-juice-cleanse","date":1767988260000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/188c3385-0001-4c9c-8edb-5c1a7a16a0ff/mjc_+8.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"2522\" height=\"1577\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/188c3385-0001-4c9c-8edb-5c1a7a16a0ff/mjc_+8.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/188c3385-0001-4c9c-8edb-5c1a7a16a0ff/mjc_+8.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/188c3385-0001-4c9c-8edb-5c1a7a16a0ff/mjc_+8.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/188c3385-0001-4c9c-8edb-5c1a7a16a0ff/mjc_+8.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/188c3385-0001-4c9c-8edb-5c1a7a16a0ff/mjc_+8.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/188c3385-0001-4c9c-8edb-5c1a7a16a0ff/mjc_+8.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/188c3385-0001-4c9c-8edb-5c1a7a16a0ff/mjc_+8.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n   \n    <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/money-juice-cleanse\">\n      explore the program\n    </a>\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p>I’d like to share my creative process for imagining and creating the container for an upcoming course, <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/money-juice-cleanse\">Money Juice Cleanse</a> — as an example and documentation of how I relate to building paid offerings with the ethos of a creative project. </p><p><em>Money Juice Cleanse is a 7 day course for doing deep, foundational money work — as a set of playful and nourishing creative practices. I’m running a live program January 26-February 4th, then it’ll be available as a self-paced course. </em><br /><br /><strong>in this post, I’ll share artifacts from the process: </strong></p><ul><li><p>how the idea came to me</p></li><li><p>brainstorming &amp; visioning process </p></li><li><p>making a “mystery page” </p></li><li><p>creating the invitations page </p></li><li><p>making visuals</p></li><li><p>writing text <br /></p></li></ul>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fc16e1af-8ebe-4fdb-9bc1-771eeacc9e0d/sketches.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fc16e1af-8ebe-4fdb-9bc1-771eeacc9e0d/sketches.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fc16e1af-8ebe-4fdb-9bc1-771eeacc9e0d/sketches.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fc16e1af-8ebe-4fdb-9bc1-771eeacc9e0d/sketches.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fc16e1af-8ebe-4fdb-9bc1-771eeacc9e0d/sketches.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fc16e1af-8ebe-4fdb-9bc1-771eeacc9e0d/sketches.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fc16e1af-8ebe-4fdb-9bc1-771eeacc9e0d/sketches.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fc16e1af-8ebe-4fdb-9bc1-771eeacc9e0d/sketches.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <h1>1 - idea &amp; brainstorming  <br /></h1><blockquote><p><strong>November 25, 2025</strong>: Money Juice Cleanse is an offering I thought up of just last week, while thinking through the structure of my new class, <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/digital-abundance\">Digital Abundance</a>. I had in my head that I wanted to create a sort of 7 day warm up for Digital Abundance — something to ease our/my way into thinking about a topic as nervous system triggering as money — and to lay the foundation for deep business infrastructure work that will be in Digital Abundance.</p><p>I don’t know where the idea for a juice cleanse came from. but after collecting images of juice cleanses (I have never done one, nor felt inspired to), and thinking about the perfect nostalgia of childhood juice boxes as a little container for sweetness &amp; nourishment… I knew that this was the perfect vessel to hold this work.</p><p>money work doesn’t always have to be so heavy, scary, and serious. it can be playful, nourishing, light, easeful, supportive. I’m a bit tired of hearing about “money healing” — healing sounds tiring, as assumes that I’m wounded or broken or un-whole in some way.</p><p>I’m excited to think through this offering, and see what it teaches me.</p></blockquote>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/27fa65d6-1eab-427b-8208-5a255438d0ef/moodboard-.png?format=1000w\" width=\"3076\" height=\"1978\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/27fa65d6-1eab-427b-8208-5a255438d0ef/moodboard-.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/27fa65d6-1eab-427b-8208-5a255438d0ef/moodboard-.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/27fa65d6-1eab-427b-8208-5a255438d0ef/moodboard-.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/27fa65d6-1eab-427b-8208-5a255438d0ef/moodboard-.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/27fa65d6-1eab-427b-8208-5a255438d0ef/moodboard-.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/27fa65d6-1eab-427b-8208-5a255438d0ef/moodboard-.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/27fa65d6-1eab-427b-8208-5a255438d0ef/moodboard-.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>with any offering, creative project, or even with written posts for my website, I always start visual first. so first, I made a moodboard of nostalgic juice box designs, illustrated juice boxes, as well as juice cleanses. </p><p>then, I thought about what the metaphorical equivalent would be, applied to doing deep money work. if the physical body = money/energetic body, what nourishing goodness would I need to distill and package into juice boxes? </p><p>I’ll also mention that I’ve had a long-time vision of opening my version of an “apothecary” — digital objects/experiences that are medicinal salves for the challenges of the creative life. this felt like an experimentation in that direction. </p><p>here’s the rough syllabus I outlined from my ~1 hour brainstorming session. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3abc266f-f5ce-4eb3-9ff4-bc5cd7e09321/MJC+planning+-+syllabus.png?format=1000w\" width=\"3102\" height=\"1670\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3abc266f-f5ce-4eb3-9ff4-bc5cd7e09321/MJC+planning+-+syllabus.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3abc266f-f5ce-4eb3-9ff4-bc5cd7e09321/MJC+planning+-+syllabus.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3abc266f-f5ce-4eb3-9ff4-bc5cd7e09321/MJC+planning+-+syllabus.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3abc266f-f5ce-4eb3-9ff4-bc5cd7e09321/MJC+planning+-+syllabus.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3abc266f-f5ce-4eb3-9ff4-bc5cd7e09321/MJC+planning+-+syllabus.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3abc266f-f5ce-4eb3-9ff4-bc5cd7e09321/MJC+planning+-+syllabus.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3abc266f-f5ce-4eb3-9ff4-bc5cd7e09321/MJC+planning+-+syllabus.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <h1>2 - making the mystery page </h1><p>what I call a “mystery page” is what most people call a “coming soon” page. I like the word mystery because, quite frankly, this offering is a mystery to myself. it’s alive and spontaneous; I’m figuring it out as I go — and usually teaching feels like this; like riding the edge between what I spent a decade learning (the hard way) and embodying, and how it wants to be channeled <em>through</em> me — in new and unexpected ways. so I’m simultaneously the magician and the detective, discovering this ofering alongside everyone else. </p><p>the ingredients of my mystery page are (1) visual image (2) brief text description (3) interest form, so that people can tell me they’re interested. </p><p>part of the purpose of an interest form and a mystery page — is, to <strong>commit myself.</strong> like everyone else, I get distracted and I have a gazillion ideas pulling on my attention. I need to be held accountable. </p><p>so I created this visual, wrote a paragraph of text in 15 minutes (pulled from my notes to self), made a Notion form, and sent it in my December newsletter. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b68bf8bc-d2cc-407d-96b1-92cea308d8e6/MJC+header+drawing+process.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b68bf8bc-d2cc-407d-96b1-92cea308d8e6/MJC+header+drawing+process.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b68bf8bc-d2cc-407d-96b1-92cea308d8e6/MJC+header+drawing+process.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b68bf8bc-d2cc-407d-96b1-92cea308d8e6/MJC+header+drawing+process.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b68bf8bc-d2cc-407d-96b1-92cea308d8e6/MJC+header+drawing+process.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b68bf8bc-d2cc-407d-96b1-92cea308d8e6/MJC+header+drawing+process.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b68bf8bc-d2cc-407d-96b1-92cea308d8e6/MJC+header+drawing+process.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b68bf8bc-d2cc-407d-96b1-92cea308d8e6/MJC+header+drawing+process.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <blockquote><p><strong>December 1, 2025: </strong>I made this visual from 11AM-2PM today (3 hours), starting by (1) drawing juice boxes (2) arranging them into a composition (3) apply color (4) lettering (5) visual texture &amp; details. I let myself make this luscious and luxurious and take my time with this — technically it’s not a V0.1, but a V1.0 that’s meant to encapsulate the essence — literal juice — of this offering.</p></blockquote>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8076f5a-792c-4703-a517-1c5e17b61bbe/mystery+page.png?format=1000w\" width=\"3278\" height=\"1922\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8076f5a-792c-4703-a517-1c5e17b61bbe/mystery+page.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8076f5a-792c-4703-a517-1c5e17b61bbe/mystery+page.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8076f5a-792c-4703-a517-1c5e17b61bbe/mystery+page.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8076f5a-792c-4703-a517-1c5e17b61bbe/mystery+page.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8076f5a-792c-4703-a517-1c5e17b61bbe/mystery+page.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8076f5a-792c-4703-a517-1c5e17b61bbe/mystery+page.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8076f5a-792c-4703-a517-1c5e17b61bbe/mystery+page.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><h1>3 - the invitation page </h1><p><br />what other people call “sales page,” I call the invitations page. it is a container where I give myself the space to discover the offering — and share what it’s about, so that the right people will feel attracted to it, and respond to the invitation. making an offering is a vulnerable thing, so I actually do want to be specific enough that the right people will invite themselves, and the “wrong” people will un-invite themselves. the goal is not to optimize for sales. the goal is to find the right match, and to do so, I need to be crystal clear about what this is, and what it isn’t. </p><p>*</p><p>I started making the invitations page yesterday and spent 3 hours on the visuals (while being quite distracted) and about 3 hours on writing the text. as mentioned, I always start visuals-first. recently, I’ve been relating to my teaching with the storytelling energy of creating picturebooks. I’m excited by the idea that each course, while not having its own website world, could still feel like its own visual world — with a color palette, aesthetics, visual logic, and “brand.” like a snowglobe within a snowglobe, a world within my universe. </p><p>this is similar to <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/imagining-labyrinth-library\" target=\"_blank\">how I created the invitations page for Labyrinth Library</a> — starting with mysterious motifs that connected me to the essence of the offering. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/014940ab-accb-4afa-aebe-dadfa7ff4cf4/money+tree.png?format=1000w\" width=\"763\" height=\"782\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/014940ab-accb-4afa-aebe-dadfa7ff4cf4/money+tree.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/014940ab-accb-4afa-aebe-dadfa7ff4cf4/money+tree.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/014940ab-accb-4afa-aebe-dadfa7ff4cf4/money+tree.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/014940ab-accb-4afa-aebe-dadfa7ff4cf4/money+tree.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/014940ab-accb-4afa-aebe-dadfa7ff4cf4/money+tree.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/014940ab-accb-4afa-aebe-dadfa7ff4cf4/money+tree.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/014940ab-accb-4afa-aebe-dadfa7ff4cf4/money+tree.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>I sketched these 4 visual ideas very absent-mindedly — the idea that there is a life source for the money juice boxes. somehow, it started with a tree, and ended with the juice boxes. I wanted to show a journey, and I let go of the idea that it had to be super literal or make a lot of logical sense. instead I sensed into whatever images wanted to emerge from about ~30 minutes of drawing, for each. the whole thing took me 3 hours. I was on the phone with K for the last 2 drawings. I am not a very good multi-tasker, so I think the quality suffered a tiny bit. but, I let it be enough. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8c3a068-0f60-4aa9-ab96-d7c39bf2603d/ingredients+.png?format=1000w\" width=\"685\" height=\"611\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8c3a068-0f60-4aa9-ab96-d7c39bf2603d/ingredients+.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8c3a068-0f60-4aa9-ab96-d7c39bf2603d/ingredients+.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8c3a068-0f60-4aa9-ab96-d7c39bf2603d/ingredients+.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8c3a068-0f60-4aa9-ab96-d7c39bf2603d/ingredients+.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8c3a068-0f60-4aa9-ab96-d7c39bf2603d/ingredients+.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8c3a068-0f60-4aa9-ab96-d7c39bf2603d/ingredients+.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/b8c3a068-0f60-4aa9-ab96-d7c39bf2603d/ingredients+.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/300296b4-6203-4b59-8062-4650c3d5945c/the+alchemy.png?format=1000w\" width=\"1392\" height=\"2124\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/300296b4-6203-4b59-8062-4650c3d5945c/the+alchemy.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/300296b4-6203-4b59-8062-4650c3d5945c/the+alchemy.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/300296b4-6203-4b59-8062-4650c3d5945c/the+alchemy.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/300296b4-6203-4b59-8062-4650c3d5945c/the+alchemy.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/300296b4-6203-4b59-8062-4650c3d5945c/the+alchemy.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/300296b4-6203-4b59-8062-4650c3d5945c/the+alchemy.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/300296b4-6203-4b59-8062-4650c3d5945c/the+alchemy.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>then, after I completed the visuals, I started writing the text for the invitations page in this order — from what felt most tangible to what felt more conceptual. </p><ul><li><p>what’s inside (elements) </p></li><li><p>7 day program (syllabus) </p></li><li><p>why this offering (overview) </p></li><li><p>who this is for </p></li><li><p>FAQ &amp; other details </p></li></ul><p>I noticed that in the process of writing, I found a lot of clarity that was already there, waiting for me to discover it. it’s really important to me that <strong>making an offering feels like an adventure of discovery.</strong> I get bored so easily, so if I’m bored by my own offering, then that’s the quickest way to kill it, and waste my time and creative energy, not to mention make no money to keep it generative. </p><p>thus, I allow myself to go on creative tangents, draw unexpected things, write as a process of sketching out the shape and form of whatever magical things wants to emerge. I don’t act like I have everything figured out, because I don’t. but, I’m absolutely confident that the process will take me to an outcome I’ll be very proud of. the process is the way, always. </p><p>I used to torment myself with writing the “perfect” sales page, and now making offerings feels as light and playful as making any other intense creative project. I look at my responsibility and commitments with a sense of gratitude, and all money I make from my offerings feel like true gifts from life. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d5f82767-b0ac-47f4-9e1f-9c601d07edd5/juice.png?format=1000w\" width=\"687\" height=\"682\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d5f82767-b0ac-47f4-9e1f-9c601d07edd5/juice.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d5f82767-b0ac-47f4-9e1f-9c601d07edd5/juice.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d5f82767-b0ac-47f4-9e1f-9c601d07edd5/juice.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d5f82767-b0ac-47f4-9e1f-9c601d07edd5/juice.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d5f82767-b0ac-47f4-9e1f-9c601d07edd5/juice.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d5f82767-b0ac-47f4-9e1f-9c601d07edd5/juice.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d5f82767-b0ac-47f4-9e1f-9c601d07edd5/juice.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><em>if you’re curious, join me for the live session of </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/money-juice-cleanse\"><em>Money Juice Cleanse,</em></a><em> Jan 26-Feb 4. </em></p><p><em>I’ll also be teaching a business course, </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/digital-abundance\"><em>Digital Abundance</em></a><em>, in March, where we’ll go step-by-step on imagining, building, and releasing your offerings. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"cf13a050b49dc2adf684e46fdeca9af5ed9416c14b67d3d1d3678383a0e52712","category":"Sites"}